# Voice modes (caveman / ultracave)

Do **not** enable caveman/ultracave on every turn.

Activate only when the user says `/caveman`, `/ultracave`, `/caveman ultra`, “caveman mode”, “talk like caveman”, “be brief”, “less tokens”, or attaches the skill. Then read and follow the skill:

- caveman: `~/.agents/skills/caveman/SKILL.md` (also `~/.cursor/caveman/skills/caveman`)
- ultracave: `~/.agents/skills/ultracave/SKILL.md` (also `~/.cursor/caveman/skills/ultracave`); `/caveman ultra` → ultracave

Stay on until “stop caveman” or “normal mode”. `/caveman status` reports mode only (no activation).
